				"description": "API - Create Account with TPA Group Type\n\n**Test ID:** SF-550-API-003\n**Priority:** p1\n**Tags:** @api-update\n\n**Note:** Account Type cannot be changed once set (Salesforce validation rule), so we create the account with TPA Group from the start."
			},
			"response": []
